description.content:
Get the tracking URL based on the parent_id (company or sub-company).

Query Parameters:
    parent_id: Company or sub-company name (from CompanyInfoQueryParams)

Returns:
    Tracking URL for the specified parent with is_default flag

Example Response (specific mapping):
    {
        "status_code": 200,
        "response_type": "success",
        "description": "Tracking URL retrieved successfully",
        "data": {
            "tracking_url": "https://sca-cvc-prod.covatic.io/mobile/api/v1.0",
            "is_default": false
        }
    }

Example Response (default/fallback):
    {
        "status_code": 200,
        "response_type": "success",
        "description": "Tracking URL retrieved successfully",
        "data": {
            "tracking_url": "https://mobile-cvc-fra-cvc-dev.covatic.io/mobile/api/v1.0",
            "is_default": true
        }
    }

